Since study efficiency does influence 
\begin_inset Formula $\mbox{GPA}_{i}$
\end_inset

, then this is not a promising development for their research design.
 The identifying assumption may not hold because of some unobserved factors
 of study efficiency may be affected by the presence of the roommate video
